      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, what? why did you bring up goblins? i'm just trying to fix our inventory levels.\n\ncan we just focus on the actual logistics? you mentioned calibration or human error—can you go into more detail about how we could check if the unit of measure is wrong? like, if someone is scanning cases instead of individual units?",
